<title>HUNGARY: ISRAEL'S NETANYAHU TO VISIT HUNGARY IN SEPTEMBER (RDN).</title>
<headline>ISRAEL'S NETANYAHU TO VISIT HUNGARY IN SEPTEMBER (RDN).</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu will pay a three-day visit to Hungary on September 19 as part of a tour of central and eastern Europe, a Hungarian government spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Netanyahu will arrive from Bucharest and will go on to Vienna, the spokesman for the Hungarian prime minister Gyula Horn told Hungarian news agency MTI. REUTER</p>
